{"id":"c209552a90f2623f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-omega-ce.md","title":"ω-c.e. 的有界归约与 tt 表征","display":"thm-omega-ce — ω-c.e. 的有界归约与 tt 表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-omega-ce","aliases":["20-thm-omega-ce"],"display":"thm-omega-ce — ω-c.e. 的有界归约与 tt 表征","chapter":"3","section":"3.8.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 3.8.8（保留最新停止值的阶段构造）","source_printed_pages":[76],"source_pdf_pages":[112],"depends_on":["[[20-df-nce]]","[[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]","[[20-df-truth-table]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-change-set]]","[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-omega-ce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-omega-ce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-ce — ω-c.e. 的有界归约与 tt 表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 3.8.8（保留最新停止值的阶段构造）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"24856bb9ed3c13f4\" href=\"?note=24856bb9ed3c13f4\" title=\"20-df-bounded-reducibility\">20-df-bounded-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0bf7676225746ee2\" href=\"?note=0bf7676225746ee2\" title=\"20-df-change-set\">20-df-change-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}\\)</span> 都为集合间关系。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"24856bb9ed3c13f4\" href=\"?note=24856bb9ed3c13f4\" title=\"20-df-bounded-reducibility\">20-df-bounded-reducibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"202d3cae13e0389b\" href=\"?note=202d3cae13e0389b\" title=\"20-df-truth-table\">20-df-truth-table</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0bf7676225746ee2\" href=\"?note=0bf7676225746ee2\" title=\"20-df-change-set\">20-df-change-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"01d522a0b0df3738\" href=\"?note=01d522a0b0df3738\" title=\"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation\">20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega-ce}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OmegaCE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}K\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}K.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}omega-ce}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OmegaCE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{bT}}K\\Longleftrightarrow A\\le_{\\mathrm{tt}}K.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>tt 显然蕴含 bT。给带全可计算查询界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)\">\\(h(x)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^K=\\chi_A\">\\(\\Phi_e^K=\\chi_A\\)</span>，取递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_s\">\\(K_s\\)</span>；近似从 0 开始，当前有限模拟停止且输出二值、use 不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)\">\\(h(x)\\)</span> 时更新为该值，未满足时保留原值。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_s\\upharpoonright h(x)\">\\(K_s\\upharpoonright h(x)\\)</span> 的区间内，确定性使所有合界停止输出相同，所以最多发生一次值改变；该前缀至多变化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)\">\\(h(x)\\)</span> 次，得到界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)+1\">\\(h(x)+1\\)</span>。最终正确前缀稳定且真正计算被发现，故近似收敛。不能在每次未停止时都重置为 0，否则可能产生额外变化。反向，有界改变集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a\">\\(C_a\\)</span> c.e.；输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的总改变数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(x)\">\\(b(x)\\)</span>，读取第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 列前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(x)\">\\(b(x)\\)</span> 个成员并取基数奇偶，是一个真值表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_a\">\\(C_a\\)</span> 由 c.e. 一一完备性归约到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>，组合得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{tt}K\">\\(A\\le_{tt}K\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 3.8.8（保留最新停止值的阶段构造）；印刷页 76；PDF 第 112 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-nce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-bounded-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-bounded-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-truth-table","status":"resolved","id":"202d3cae13e0389b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-truth-table]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-change-set","status":"resolved","id":"0bf7676225746ee2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-change-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"01d522a0b0df3738","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-bounded-re